	(text "Indicators -- system status LED (D4)"
		(at 30.48 25.40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "11111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000001")
	)
	(text "Wired with global labels + short wires.\n\nCHARGE LED: not on this sheet. The MCP73831 charge LED already exists, wired,\non power_bms.kicad_sch as D2 + R10 (VBUS -> R10 -> D2 -> CHG_STAT), exactly\nthe topology in Microchip DS20001984H Fig. 6-1/Section 3.3. This sheet used to\ncarry a second D2/R10 pair; it was a duplicate (same reference designators on\ntwo sheets) and was removed.\n\nSYSTEM LED: P0.14 (DWM3001C pin 7, label LED_SYS) -> R13 1k -> D4 -> GND,\nactive high. I ~ (3.3V - Vf) / 1k, about 1.2 mA for a green/red 0603 LED.\nnRF52833 pin drive strength is NOT verified here (Product Specification not\nobtained); Qorvo DS Rev B Table 5 only gives drive current for the DW3110\npins. Firmware should pulse the LED, not hold it on -- the tag is the\npower-constrained side.\n\n0603 LED and resistor, per project standard."
		(at 30.48 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "11111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000002")
	)
